<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gap said raised by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gap said raised by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs upgraded Gap Inc to the firm's priority list from its recommended list, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Monday at 30-3/8.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
